font:400 18.5px/26px georgia,serif;margin:0 0 10px"><span>By Dylan Freedman=
</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margi=
n:0 0 15px"><span>I use artificial intelligence in my work every day.</span=
></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 =
15px"><span>As the A.I. projects editor for The New York Times, my job is t=
wofold: I enlist A.I. to help reporters find needles in vast haystacks of d=
ocuments and multimedia data =E2=80=94 like </span><a href=3D"https://nl.ny=
times.com/f/newsletter/F82u-7zfDg1j7r2ZIM_6uw~~/AAAAARA~/w62V0dpyGczYfO06eh=
wK9pfvmCx5N41Wjn1l00qudd0s9eCBJLKKs_GKAgcdtUwNyte5mt9z7OWhq_fskde4cNX0hEJXl=
