ation:underline;text-decoration:underline">President Trump=E2=80=99s speech=
es</a><span> =E2=80=94 and I report on developments in A.I. technology. But=
 I also draw a thick line: I never, ever, use A.I. for writing.</span></p><=
p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px">=
<span>Which is why I often write with a typewriter.</span></p><p style=3D"f=
ont:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>I comp=
ose most of my first drafts, including for this article, on an Olivetti Let=
tera 22 from the 1950s. The typewriter provides me with an essential dose o=
f minimalism, a break from the crowded browser tabs and blinking terminal w=
indows on my computer screen.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px g=
eorgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>I was a software engineer at=
 Google before pursuing a journalism degree. As a technologist, I am always=
 itching for the best tool to get a job done. And when it comes to translat=
ing my thoughts into words, the typewriter is a marvel.</span></p><p style=
=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Y=
ou can use it outside, without glare. You don=E2=80=99t need to recharge it=
=2E A single ribbon lasts longer than most novels and is cheaper than print=
er ink. Made from solid steel, most mechanical typewriters are practically =
indestructible.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;c=
olor:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>The typewriter has few comforts but also n=
o distractions. Using one feels intentional, like taking photographs on a f=
ilm camera. Typing on this metal machine, I find a rawness that better capt=
ures my voice. You can=E2=80=99t easily undo =E2=80=94 nor should you.</spa=
n></p><table border=3D"0" cellpadding=3D"0" cellspacing=3D"0" style=3D"widt=
h:100%"><tbody><tr><td style=3D"text-align:center"><img width=3D"500" heigh=
