"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Yest=
erday was Thanksgiving, my favorite American holiday.</span></p><p style=3D=
"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>It=
=E2=80=99s not a holiday I grew up with. The closest thing we have in Germa=
ny is =E2=80=9CErntedankfest,=E2=80=9D a harvest celebration parade I used =
to watch in my grandmother=E2=80=99s village in northern Germany featuring =
marching bands and tractors carrying autumn crops all culminating in a booz=
y village fair. Versions of this exist in several countries.</span></p><p s=
tyle=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><sp=
an>But American Thanksgiving is different. It=E2=80=99s a more intimate aff=
air, a coming together of family and friends, gathered around a generous me=
al, often a potluck to which everyone contributes, in the service of, well,=
 giving thanks.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;c=
olor:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>I experienced my first Thanksgiving as a s=
tudent with my host family in New Mexico. The food was =E2=80=A6 not for me=
 (I will never understand pumpkin pie). But the dinner was lovely. We went =
around the table saying what we were grateful for. I had never done that in=
 this intentional way before and it was powerful.</span></p><p style=3D"fon=
t:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Since th=
en, I attend Thanksgiving dinners whenever I can. I had an American housema=
te in London who would always host one. My brother married a Californian wh=
o hosts every year (and is also the best cook on Earth).</span></p><p style=
=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>B=
ut I missed it this year and so I thought I=E2=80=99d share a couple of thi=
ngs, big and small, that I=E2=80=99m grateful for here:</span></p><p style=
=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>T=
he health and safety of my family.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/2=
5px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>All my incredible femal=
e friends.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:=
#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Working for a newspaper that still has the reso=
urces to do real reporting.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px geo=
rgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Going dancing in Paris last Sa=
turday.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#33=
3;margin:0 0 15px"><span>And I am grateful for you, my readers around the w=
orld, who are so curious and engaged. If there=E2=80=99s anything </span><s=
pan style=3D"font-style:italic">you</span><span> are grateful for that you=
=E2=80=99d like to share, I=E2=80=99d love to hear about it.</span></p><p s=
tyle=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><sp=
